%% Global Audit & Activity Logging (Phase 11, ADR 0040)
flowchart TD
    subgraph WRITE [Write path — explicit + transactional]
      MUT[Business mutation<br/>e.g. invoices.issue] --> TX{{withTenantContext scope<br/>ONE transaction}}
      TX --> ST[state change]
      ST --> OBX[outbox.emit tx<br/>async propagation · ADR 0013]
      OBX --> AUD[audit.record tx<br/>*** authoritative · synchronous ***]
      AUD --> CAT[catalogue check<br/>AUDIT_ACTION_UNKNOWN]
      AUD --> ACT[resolve actor server-side<br/>userActor scope · or withSystemAuditActor]
      AUD --> RED[sanitizeMetadata / sanitizeChanges<br/>strip secrets · bound size]
      AUD --> CTX[correlation id · request id · ip · ua<br/>from ALS · occurred_at = DB clock]
      CAT --> INS[(INSERT audit_logs)]
      ACT --> INS
      RED --> INS
      CTX --> INS
      INS --> CM{{COMMIT — state + audit together, or neither}}
    end

    INS --- G{{aivoryx_app: SELECT + INSERT only<br/>UPDATE / DELETE REVOKEd}}
    INS --- R{{ENABLE + FORCE RLS<br/>tenant SELECT policy · tenant INSERT WITH CHECK<br/>NO update/delete policy}}
    INS --- FK{{composite FK actor,tenant<br/>ON DELETE SET NULL actor_membership_id}}

    subgraph READ [Read path — audit.read only]
      API[/GET /admin/audit  ·  /admin/audit/:id/] --> QS[server-side filters<br/>from/to · actor · action · module · entity · page]
      QS --> SEL[(SELECT audit_logs<br/>RLS-scoped to tenant)]
      SEL --> JN[LEFT JOIN membership -> user<br/>actor name/email · no N+1]
      JN --> DTO[AuditLogDto / AuditLogDetailDto<br/>never the raw row]
      DTO --> UI[/admin/audit console<br/>table + filters + detail drawer<br/>changes: from -> to · metadata k/v]
    end

    CM -.->|append-only history| SEL
